][/dim]under 2 s on athena, the part of startup that grows with every [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]dismissed agent stops growing, and a durable startup telemetry [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]record makes both claims checkable in a real terminal instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]modelled from component measurements.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]6[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ace_startup_critical_path.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/ace_startup_critical_path.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-k3[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-k3/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Durable startup telemetry[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]telemetry[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]telemetry: record one JSONL row per ACE session carrying both a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]visible-surface-ready and an all-surfaces-ready time plus the component [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]budget, make the loader-stage log threshold env-overridable so sub-2 s [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stages are capturable, and document the before/after capture recipe.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Two module-level import defects[/bold #D7AFFF]                               [bold black on #5FD7AF] xsmall [/bold black on #5FD7AF]\n    [#AF87FF]imports[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]imports: move the `sase.axe.state` import in toast_log out of module [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scope, drop the module-level `unittest.mock` import from the Patch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]loade